      "description": "As a \nShopper, \nI want\n to save a product to my Wishlist from the PDP, \nso that \nI can keep track of items I love and return to purchase them later.\nImage for reference (Figma leading): \nThe wishlist icon is displayed on the PDP at all times. \nIf the customer clicks the wishlist icon without selecting a size first, they are prompted to select a size. \nOnce a size is selected, guest customers are shown the login/create account modal before the item is saved. \nThe sign-in modal itself (authentication flow) is out of scope for this story — that is covered in the Wishlist epic.\nAuthenticated customers see the wishlist icon update to its active (selected) state immediately upon wishlisting. \nItems are saved at size level per colour variant. Each colour variant of a product is treated independently, meaning the same size can be wishlisted across multiple colour variants. \nDeselecting the wishlist icon on PDP removes the item from the wishlist.",
