      "id": "18751",
      "key": "SFCC-405",
      "summary": "Cart – Page-Level Success Banner Component",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a clear confirmation message when a cart action has completed successfully, so that I know my action has been processed without having to second-guess the outcome.\nThis component is a reusable page-level success banner that appears at the top of the cart page when a cart action completes successfully. Known triggers include: removing a line item from the cart (SFCC-272); moving a line item to the wishlist (SFCC-272). The success message for Move to Wishlist dynamically inserts the product name e.g. Solstice Scarf Tie Bikini has been moved to your wishlist - the product name must be passed to the banner component at the point of trigger. The banner persists on the page until the Shopper navigates away - there is no auto-dismiss timer and no X icon. Confirmed behaviour from Magento site. Success message copy is configurable. Designs not yet available - Figma is leading. This story supersedes SFCC-403 which should be closed in favour of this story.\nPROD Screenshot",
