      "key": "SFCC-357",
      "summary": "Checkout – Collect in Boutique: Store List (Available State)",
      "description": "As a Shopper selecting Collect in Boutique, I want to see a list of available boutiques with their details, so that I can select the most convenient store for collection.\\n\\nThis component appears on the Collect in Boutique tab below the map (Image 1). It renders as an alphabetically ordered list of boutiques within the customer's storefront region, with outlet stores listed last. Each boutique row displays: a radio button selector, boutique name, address, open/closed status indicator, distance from customer, opening hours (Mon–Sat and Sun), phone number, email address, and a \"View Map\" link. The currently selected boutique is shown with a filled radio button. Boutiques with the BOPIS flag disabled in AP21/NewStore are hidden. States or regions where all boutiques have the BOPIS flag disabled are also hidden (CFD-046). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-034, CFD-035, CFD-036, CFD-045, CFD-046. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-85 (Real-time Stock Check / NewStore), SFCC-64 (Google Maps API).",
