      "id": "18685",
      "key": "SFCC-351",
      "summary": "Checkout – Billing Address Form: Logged-In, Add New Billing Address",
      "description": "As a registered Shopper, I want to add a new billing address that is different from any of my saved addresses, so that my payment can be processed to a new location.\\n\\nThis component represents the add new billing address state, reached when a logged-in user with saved addresses selects \"Add New\" or a similar option from the billing address dropdown (SFCC-345). A back-navigation dropdown labelled \"New address\" sits at the top, allowing the customer to return to their saved address list without leaving checkout. Below it the full billing address form is rendered: first name and last name pre-filled from account, Country dropdown, address autocomplete text field, and PO Box / Parcel Locker warning text. No phone number field is shown in the billing address section. Address autocomplete is powered by Google Places API (see SFCC-337, SFCC-64). If the customer has enabled save-to-account, the new billing address is saved to their address book (CFD-063). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-058, CFD-059, CFD-060, CFD-062, CFD-063, CFD-065. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Address Autocomplete), My Account address book epic.",
