      "key": "SFCC-348",
      "summary": "Checkout – Delivery Address Form: Logged-In, No Saved Address (Blank Form)",
      "description": "As a registered Shopper with no saved addresses, I want to enter my delivery address in a form at checkout, so that my order can be shipped to my chosen location.\\n\\nThis component represents the delivery address state for logged-in users who have no addresses saved to their account. Because there are no saved addresses, no address dropdown is shown — the form renders as a blank entry form equivalent to the guest state (SFCC-333), but the customer is authenticated. Fields rendered: First name and last name (pre-filled from account), Country dropdown (pre-populated from storefront locale, editable), address autocomplete text field, PO Box / Parcel Locker warning text, phone country prefix dropdown (see SFCC-339), mobile number text input, and \"For delivery purposes only\" checkbox. Address autocomplete is powered by Google Places API (see SFCC-337, SFCC-64). Upon order completion the address is saved to the customer's address book. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-022, CFD-024, CFD-025, CFD-027, CFD-028, CFD-029, CFD-031. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Address Autocomplete), My Account address book epic.",
