    {
      "id": "18613",
      "key": "SFCC-315",
      "summary": "Cart Page – Bag Overlay Component",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want the cart to open as a full-screen overlay that takes over the page, so that I can view and manage my bag with full focus before returning to browsing.\nWhen triggered, the cart renders as a full-screen overlay that takes over the entire screen — it is not a partial slide-in panel. The background page content is obscured behind the overlay. The overlay has two header states depending on cart content — when the cart contains items the header displays \"BAG\" with a dynamic item count and an X close icon; when the cart is empty the header displays \"YOUR BAG IS EMPTY\" with an X close icon. This component is the container for all other cart stories and is a dependency for SFCC-270 through SFCC-301.\nAll cart state and item count data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit. The overlay itself is a PWA Kit component — no Contentful involvement in the overlay/header behaviour.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):\nFull Cart\n!image-20260803-235728.png|alt=\"image-20260803-235728.png\"!\nEmpty Cart\n!image-20260803-235740.png|alt=\"image-20260803-235740.png\"!",
