    {
      "id": "18554",
      "key": "SFCC-277",
      "summary": "Cart – Empty Cart State: Display Logic & Component Render Order",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a helpful message when my cart is empty, so that I understand the bag is empty and am guided toward browsing or contacting support.\nThis story covers the empty cart state component on the cart page. It is the container for several sub-components, each owned by a different story or epic:\nCart drawer panel and header — SFCC-315 (Cart epic)\nClient Services contact details and copy — fetched from Contentful, SFCC-306 (Contentful Components epic — SFCC-304)\nZimmermann Benefits content — fetched from Contentful, SFCC-316 (Contentful Components epic — SFCC-304)\nRecommendation component slot — SFCC-301 (Search & Recommendations epic — SFCC-7)\nThis story covers the empty cart state page component only — the PWA Kit component that renders the empty state layout and fetches Contentful content at runtime. All sub-component builds are dependencies of this story.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):",
