                          },
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Open question for dev: when a basket merge results in a combined quantity that exceeds the SKU or customer group limit, what is SFCC OOTB behaviour? Does SFCC automatically cap the quantity at the configured limit, or does it allow the quantity to exceed the limit and require the customer to manually reduce it before proceeding? Cart logic. ",
                                  "marks": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "textColor",
