    {
      "id": "18730",
      "key": "SFCC-395",
      "summary": "Gift Card – Checkout Redemption: Valid Card State (Expiry & Remaining Balance Display)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see confirmation that my gift card is valid along with its balance and expiry date after entering my details, so that I know how much will be applied to my order.\\n\\nThis component represents the valid card state of the checkout redemption form, shown after the customer enters a valid gift card number and PIN and GiveX confirms the card (Image 9 from earlier designs). It renders: the entered card number and PIN retained in the fields, a confirmation line below reading \"Gift card valid Expires [date]\" on the left and \"[amount] remain\" on the right, and the Apply CTA button remains visible. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout payment step. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit.\\n\\nNote: this story sits correctly in SFCC-17 (Credit Notes & Gift Cards).\\n\\nDepends on GC-039, GC-041. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-78 (GiveX Gift Card Integration), SFCC-393 (Redemption Form), SFCC-394 (Check Balance & GiveX Validation).",
      "status": {
        "name": "To Do",
        "category": "To Do",
        "color": "blue-gray"
      },
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "18724",
      "key": "SFCC-389",
      "summary": "Gift Card – Cart Line Item: Physical (Image, Price, Qty, Move to Wishlist & Remove)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see my physical gift card displayed in the cart with the ability to adjust quantity or remove it, so that I can manage my order before purchasing.\\n\\nThis component appears in the full cart when a physical gift card is in the bag (GC-016). It renders: gift card image, price, and quantity. Actions: quantity adjust (GC-017), Move to Wishlist, and Remove (GC-018). Unlike the digital gift card, no personalisation details are shown and there is no Edit action. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC cart page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit.\\n\\nNote: this story is currently created in SFCC-17 (Credit Notes & Gift Cards) for speed but should be moved to SFCC-11 (Cart) as the UI component lives on the cart surface. Flag for Cart epic pass.\\n\\nDepends on GC-016, GC-017, GC-018. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-11 (Cart epic), Wishlist epic.",
      "status": {
        "name": "To Do",
        "category": "To Do",
        "color": "blue-gray"
      },
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they view the full cart, then the line item displays: gift card image, price, and quantity only — no personalisation details are shown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they view the line item, then no Edit action is displayed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they adjust the quantity, then the quantity updates and the cart totals reflect the change."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they click Remove, then the gift card is removed from the cart and cart totals update accordingly."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they click Move to Wishlist, then the gift card is moved to the wishlist and removed from the cart."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given a Guest Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they click Move to Wishlist, then they are redirected to the login page before the wishlist action is completed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7. Given a Shopper has a physical gift card in their cart, when they view the line item, then the maximum quantity per SKU is capped at 3 units (per GC-019)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
